Debug.Assert(OLD(_version) + 1 == RET);
</code>

The assert statement `Debug.Assert(OLD(_version) + 1 == RET)` checks whether the value of _version is incremented by one after calling the method `Add(Object value)`. RET refers to the return value of the method, which in this case is the value of _size after it is incremented by one. The OLD(_version) refers to the original value of _version before the method is called.
